# Jak II's effects on the simulated headset (LIST-0.1.5 item 13, the owner: "jak 2 and 3 have issues with certain
# affects putting a colored square in front of your face, in jak 2 lightning an certain impacts"), run with
# JAKVR_TEST_GUN=1 (the four guns, Dark Jak with his meter full and his bombs): a new game to the fortress exit (as
# jak2_gun.sim), then Dark Jak by a quick squeeze of the left grip (0.1.5's Dark Jak button; expect "[vr-pad] a quick
# squeeze of the left grip: L2"): pictures of his change and its lightning, a punch, a jump and a dive (his bomb and
# its lightning), looking down at it. Once he is back, the gun drawn and each gun picked on the d-pad (the left thumb on
# its rest, the right stick right, down, left, up) and fired at the ground by his feet and ahead, pictures 2, 4 and 12
# frames after each shot (and later ones for the gun that charges).
